@* The root component of the Blazor Web App foundation.

   Static server rendering only. No @rendermode directive here, on Routes, or on
   the layout, and no global mode is applied in Program.cs — an interactive mode
   has to be asked for per component, so a read-only taxpayer page cannot
   silently become a circuit surface.

   The local framework script activates only components that explicitly select
   an interactive render mode. Static SSR remains the default; review and
   accountant pages never become circuits.

   Every asset is local and tracked in this repository: no CDN script, remote
   stylesheet, remote font, or third-party image. *@

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <base href="/" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="portal.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="intake.css" />
    @* Component-scoped CSS bundle: PortalLayout.razor.css and
       ReviewPage.razor.css are compiled into this one local file. *@
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="TaxAI.Portal.styles.css" />
    <HeadOutlet />
</head>
<body>
    <Routes />
    <script src="_framework/blazor.web.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
